==Description==
The '''Graveyard''' is a common consumable exclusively used in [[PVP]] mode.

It can be used an unlimited number of times, but it costs {{Money|150}} to use each time. It has a 30 second cooldown, with an initial cooldown of 50.

==Usage==
The player's avatar will hold a hammer, with which they will build a graveyard on the path. This will cause [[Normal]]s to spawn from the entrance of the opponent's path every 0.5 for 5 seconds, creating a total of 10 [[Normal]]s.

Currently, the exact placement of the graveyard has no impact on the summons. Originally, the graveyard would actually summon the [[Normal]]s, though this functionality was removed due to it being possible to place it down directly at the exit.

==Appearance==
The '''Graveyard''' is a small wooden coffin that appears on the path.

